    "description": "<p>Sarvam AI's Saaras V4 is a speech-to-text model covering all 22 Indian languages plus global English. It pairs an audio encoder with a 3B hybrid state-space decoder. It adds keyterm prompting for up to 50 terms, 5 output modes from 1 model, and streaming with first-token latency under 150 ms. It is available today through Sarvam's API at \u20b930 per hour.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/09/26/sarvam-ai-releases-saaras-v4-a-speech-to-text-model-for-all-22-indian-language...",
